#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判はいつ始まるんだろう…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I wonder when the class trial's gonna start..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>洗濯機だ…
#. 事件には関係ないよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a washing machine. Which has nothing to do with\n"
"the case...\n"
"<CLT>"
